  "reasoning": "The defendant fabricated official driver training records and used a privately made seal that imitates a state‑issued seal. This constitutes forging a seal of a state organ, which is punishable under the crime of forging a state organ’s seal (伪造国家机关印章罪). No other criminal conduct is described, so only this charge applies.",
